<http://data.silknow.org/object/02f1f323-067f-3ae5-86b3-e6a696d01b24>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "For Eastern Orthodox Church. Mary holding the baby Jesus who holds a globe and makes the motion of blessing. The half figure of an angel looks toward them from the upper left corner. Continuous border on the sides and bottom of a stylized blossom (?) repeating alternately with seraphim. Top border pieced; a repeating botonee cross within a circle. Outer tape border. Metal wires and silk yarns on a red satin-silk ground. Worn and missing wires; ground worn through in some areas."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/321d11f5-f483-38c4-a810-4354ec477ee1> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "For Eastern Orthodox Church. Mary holding the baby Jesus who holds a globe and makes the motion of blessing. The half figure of an angel looks toward them from the upper left corner. Continuous border on the sides and bottom of a stylized blossom (?) repeating alternately with seraphim. Top border pieced; a repeating botonee cross within a circle. Outer tape border. Metal wires and silk yarns on a red satin-silk ground. Worn and missing wires; ground worn through in some areas."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/02f1f323-067f-3ae5-86b3-e6a696d01b24/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/02f1f323-067f-3ae5-86b3-e6a696d01b24/dimension/1> ;
